<comment>
Session 009 fresh t=0 production; approved local orthonormal boost0.133215.
Left-y/right+y, approximate companion support, not exact GR equilibrium.
Source masses .76/.12/.12, envelope arealR30, isotropic centers +/-3.
5,000,000 deterministic seed4001 particles, no added spin/radial boost/recoil.
K_ij=0 leaves local momentum constraint unsolved. M_ref=1 is inherited unit,
not measured rest/horizon/ADM mass. Model and Lorentz momentum conventions unchanged.
Domain +/-1024, root256^3 dx8, logicalroot3, physicallevels0..11 dx_min1/256.
Wave floor dx<=.25 throughout r<=46; outer radial floors .5/1/2/4 to72/104/168/296.
Static seeding cubes are conservative supersets; actual complete mesh audited at gate.
r*Psi4 ell2..8 at coordinate r40 only, dt.025; f<=.4 interpretation subject to gate.
Particles .25, planes .1, full3D/checkpoints10. Clean stops write final checkpoint.
Hard t400 or10000 raw AMD nodeh including gates/failed allocations/analysis;45days.
Scientific early termination needs accepted enclosing common AH, usable band-limited
ringdown and >=100M saved after observed post-merger wave peak. No AH-only stop.
<job>
basename = s9_orbit_gw

<mesh>
